  "Know the timer or reward? Post it in our {discord}.": "Sabe o temporizador ou a recompensa? Publique no nosso {discord}.",
  "Know the timer? Post it in our {discord}.": "Sabe o temporizador? Publique no nosso {discord}.",
  "Know the reward? Post it in our {discord}.": "Sabe a recompensa? Publique no nosso {discord}.",
  "New figurine recipes: Black Division and Wedge": "Novas receitas de estatuetas: Black Division e Wedge",
  "In 66 mins the Black Division Operator figurine returns a Siege-R plate carrier and the Wedge figurine returns a CS gas grenade. Know the Team Leader timer and reward? Post it in our Discord.": "Em 66 minutos, a estatueta Black Division Operator devolve um porta-placas Siege-R e a estatueta Wedge uma granada de gás CS. Sabe o temporizador e a recompensa de Team Leader? Publique no nosso Discord.",
  "New rituals found: in 66 mins the Black Division Operator figurine returns a First Spear Siege-R plate carrier and the Wedge figurine returns a Model 8230 CS gas grenade. The Black Division Team Leader timer and reward are still unknown. If you know them, post in our {discord}. {view}": "Novos rituais encontrados: em 66 minutos, a estatueta Black Division Operator devolve um porta-placas First Spear Siege-R e a estatueta Wedge uma Model 8230 CS gas grenade. O temporizador e a recompensa de Black Division Team Leader ainda são desconhecidos. Se souber, publique no nosso {discord}. {view}",
  "View the new recipes →": "Ver as novas receitas →",
  "Unmute game": "Ativar o som",
  "Unpin item": "Desafixar item",
  "Unrecognised item — click to identify": "Item não reconhecido — clique para identificar",
  "Unspecified": "Não especificado",
